@display("std/repo")
repo: component(path = "std/repo", lang = "heron") {
  | The repository a tree's [entry point](#language.core_format.files.entry_point) stands for, its toolchain and the setup `heron run setup` runs; the interpreter backs its funcs.
  |
  | Its surface is declared in `std/repo/package.heron`, whose types the API
  | reference renders; each export is specified where its behaviour is:
  |
  | | Export                                                                   | Specified in                                                           |
  | | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |
  | | `Repository`, `repository`                                               | [Repository tasks](#language.scripting.tasks.finding.repository_tasks) |
  | | `Tool`, `ensure_toolchain`, `install_packages`, `generate`, `SetupError` | [the interpreter](#product.system.interpreter)                         |

  uses = [language.std.types]
}
